{"contract_version":"2","response_version":"3","snapshot":"373fcb69731db877929c102b75292142c0ccff1b5f6075310acc03432ddb6b8b","query":"10","status":"entity_found_tag_unmapped","entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"10"},"tag_key":null,"canonical":{"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"10"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"original","original":"An original work or character that isn't from any established [[howto:copyright|copyright]]. Basically, art that is not fanart.\r\n\r\nThis includes [[scenery]], [[still life]]s, [[animal focus]] posts, and other works with [[no humans]] or no known characters.\r\n\r\nSome art may depict original characters alongside characters from established copyrights, or a fan-made character of a specific copyright. In this case, the art should be tagged as original and with the tag for the copyright, and the tag [[OC x canon]] applied if applicable.\r\n\r\nIf the artwork shows a [i]different artist's[/i] original character, include the [[borrowed character]] tag as well.\r\n\r\nSome works on Pixiv are occasionally tagged original by accident. Art by the character designer for an established copyright also sometimes tag their work as original—on Danbooru, these should be tagged with the corresponding copyright instead.\r\n\r\nh4. Examples\r\n\r\n* !post #10154315: [[Danbooru-tan]] by [[Shibidayo]]\r\n* !post #3068019\r\n* !post #7896695\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[borrowed character]]\r\n* [[commissioner insert]]\r\n* [[OC x canon]]\r\n* [[real life]] - fanart of real people\r\n* [[adoptable]]\r\n* [[copyright request]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:1","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"original","original":"An original work or character that isn't from any established [